<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="nl">
<head>
    <%- include('./partials/head'); %>
</head>

<body class="index container">
    <header>
        <%- include('./partials/header'); %>
    </header>

    <div id="searchdiv">
        <div class="searchBar">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="24px" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="24px" fill="#485EA1"><path d="M784-120 532-372q-30 24-69 38t-83 14q-109 0-184.5-75.5T120-580q0-109 75.5-184.5T380-840q109 0 184.5 75.5T640-580q0 44-14 83t-38 69l252 252-56 56ZM380-400q75 0 127.5-52.5T560-580q0-75-52.5-127.5T380-760q-75 0-127.5 52.5T200-580q0 75 52.5 127.5T380-400Z"/></svg>
    
        <input type="search" class="search" placeholder="Waar ben je naar op zoek">
    
        <button>Zoek</button>
        </div>
    </div>
    

        
    
    <section class="landing">
        <h1>
            Start je reis
        </h1>
        <img src="../static/images/plane.png" alt="">
        <p>
            Met onze matchingtool ontdek jij in een paar klikken welke stad het beste aansluit bij jouw interesses, budget en reisstijl.
            
            Beantwoord een paar korte vragen en krijg een stad aanbevolen die bij jou past!
        </p>

        <button>
            Vind jouw perfecte stad!
        </button>
    </section>

    <section class="polaroids">
        <h2>
            Top <span>Bestemmingen</span>
        </h2>
        <p>De meest gezochte steden</p>

        <div>
            <img class = "polaroid" src="../static/images/polaroid.png" alt="">
            <img class = "polaroid" src="../static/images/polaroid.png" alt="">
            <img class = "polaroid" src="../static/images/polaroid.png" alt="">
            <img class = "polaroid" src="../static/images/polaroid.png" alt="">
            <img class = "polaroid" src="../static/images/polaroid.png" alt="">
            <img class = "polaroid" src="../static/images/polaroid.png" alt="">
        </div>
        <!-- hallo -->
    </section>

    <section class="aanbevolen">
        <h2>Aanbevolen voor jou</h2>
        <div class="gridContainer">
            <div class="cityCard1">
                <img src="../static/images/amsterdam.png" alt="">
                <div class="gradientOverlay"></div>

                <p class="cityInfo">Amsterdam</p>

                <button class="cityButton">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="size-6">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 19.5 15-15m0 0H8.25m11.25 0v11.25" />
                  </svg>
                  </button>
            </div>

            <div class="cityCard2">
                <img src="../static/images/parijs.png" alt="">
                <div class="gradientOverlay"></div>

                <p class="cityInfo">Parijs</p>
                
                <button class="cityButton">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="size-6">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 19.5 15-15m0 0H8.25m11.25 0v11.25" />
                  </svg>
                  </button>
            </div>

            <div class="cityCard3">
                <img src="../static/images/berlijn.png" alt="">
                <div class="gradientOverlay"></div>

                <p class="cityInfo">Berlijn</p>
                
                <button class="cityButton">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="size-6">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 19.5 15-15m0 0H8.25m11.25 0v11.25" />
                  </svg>
                  </button>
            </div>

            <div class="cityCard4">
                <img src="../static/images/brussel.png" alt="">
                <div class="gradientOverlay"></div>

                <p class="cityInfo">Brussel</p>
                
                <button class="cityButton">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="size-6">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 19.5 15-15m0 0H8.25m11.25 0v11.25" />
                  </svg>
                  </button>
            </div>

            <div class="cityCard5">
                <img src="../static/images/london.png" alt="">
                <div class="gradientOverlay"></div>

                <p class="cityInfo">London</p>
                
                <button class="cityButton">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="size-6">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 19.5 15-15m0 0H8.25m11.25 0v11.25" />
                  </svg>
                  </button>
            </div>

            <div class="cityCard6">
                <img src="../static/images/madrid.png" alt="">
                <div class="gradientOverlay"></div>

                <p class="cityInfo">Madrid</p>
                
                <button class="cityButton">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="size-6">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 19.5 15-15m0 0H8.25m11.25 0v11.25" />
                  </svg>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <a href="/">
            <p>Ga naar jouw matches</p>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="24px" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="24px" fill="#485EA1"><path d="M647-440H160v-80h487L423-744l57-56 320 320-320 320-57-56 224-224Z"/></svg>
        </a>
    </section>

    <section class="aboutUs">
        <h2>Wat is FlyEasy?</h2>
        <div class="aboutusdivp">
            <p>
                Wij hebben dit platform hebben gemaakt, zodat iedereen de perfecte stad kan vinden!
            </p>

            <p>
                We geloven dat reizen meer is dan alleen bestemmingen kiezen; het gaat om ontdekken, verbinden en beleven. Daarom helpen we studenten zoals jij de ideale stad te vinden op basis van jouw voorkeuren, interesses en budget
            </p>
        </div>
        

        <div class="aboutUsDiv">
            <div>
                <img src="../static/images/aboutUs.png" alt="">
                <p>Persoonlijke Reismatching</p>
            </div>

            <div>
                <img src="../static/images/aboutUs1.png" alt="">
                <p>Betaalbaar Reizen</p>
            </div>

            <div>
                <img src="../static/images/aboutUs2.png" alt="">
                <p>Community & Ervaringen</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="gids">
        <h2>Gids</h2>
        <div class="cardScroll">
            <%- include('./partials/cityCard'); %>
            <%- include('./partials/cityCard'); %>
            <%- include('./partials/cityCard'); %>
            <%- include('./partials/cityCard'); %>
            <%- include('./partials/cityCard'); %>
            <%- include('./partials/cityCard'); %> 

        </div>
    <section class="grid">
        <h1>Aanbevolen voor jou</h1>
        <div>
            <div>
                <img src="../static/images/amsterdam.png" alt="">
                <button class="arrow">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="size-6">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 19.5 15-15m0 0H8.25m11.25 0v11.25" />
                  </svg>
                  </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>



    



    
    <footer>
        <%- include('./partials/footer'); %>
    </footer>

    <script src="../static/script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>

